    "name": "多益文法 Part 5 精選",
    "description": "TOEIC Part 5 風格文法題：時態、詞性、介係詞、連接詞、關係代名詞、假設語氣等",
    "language": "en",
    "questions": [
      {
        "id": "90cce0eb-a77c-4090-af63-7bb3c305581a",
        "type": "multiple_choice",
        "prompt": "The marketing team will submit the proposal ___ the end of this week.",
        "options": [
          "by",
          "until",
          "on",
          "in"
        ],
        "correctIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "by + 時間點表示「在…之前完成」；until 強調持續到某時間點。提案是一次性完成的動作，用 by。",
        "tags": [],
        "stats": {
          "correctCount": 0,
          "incorrectCount": 0,
          "lastReviewedAt": null
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "063d25c4-1733-4ad9-9dc7-2e9b45e2e317",
        "type": "multiple_choice",
        "prompt": "All employees are required to attend the ___ scheduled training session.",
        "options": [
          "regular",
          "regularly",
          "regularity",
          "regularize"
        ],
        "correctIndex": 1,
        "explanation": "空格修飾過去分詞 scheduled（排定的），修飾形容詞/分詞要用副詞 regularly。",
        "tags": [],
        "stats": {
          "correctCount": 0,
          "incorrectCount": 0,
          "lastReviewedAt": null
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "ba177cb5-0191-45f8-b142-57989d94a4e4",
        "type": "multiple_choice",
        "prompt": "___ the heavy rain, the outdoor event proceeded as planned.",
        "options": [
          "Despite",
          "Although",
          "Because",
          "However"
        ],
        "correctIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Despite + 名詞片語；Although + 子句；However 是副詞不能直接接名詞。空格後是名詞 the heavy rain，故用 Despite。",
        "tags": [],
        "stats": {
          "correctCount": 0,
          "incorrectCount": 0,
          "lastReviewedAt": null
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "4d3eca1e-802c-426e-a77c-bb3d22ec5a51",
        "type": "multiple_choice",
        "prompt": "The new software makes it much easier ___ customer data.",
