          "analyzed",
          "to analyze",
          "analyzing"
        ],
        "correctIndex": 2,
        "explanation": "make it + 形容詞 + to V 是固定句型，it 是虛受詞，真正的受詞是不定詞片語。",
        "tags": [],
        "stats": {
          "correctCount": 0,
          "incorrectCount": 0,
